flowchart LR
  user([Browser]) -->|HTTPS 443 / :3000| fe[Web app<br/>nginx + React]
  api([API client]) -->|:8080| lb[gateway-lb<br/>nginx]
  fe --> gw1[API gateway 1]
  fe --> gw2[API gateway 2]
  lb --> gw1
  lb --> gw2
  subgraph discovery[Service discovery]
    e1[(Eureka 1)] <-->|replication| e2[(Eureka 2)]
  end
  gw1 & gw2 -->|lb:// · circuit breaker · retry| auth[auth-service]
  gw1 & gw2 --> room[room-service]
  gw1 & gw2 --> b1[booking-service ×2]
  gw1 & gw2 --> pay[payment-service]
  gw1 & gw2 --> notif[notification-service]
  b1 -->|holds · confirm · release| room
  b1 -->|payments · refunds| pay
  pay -->|payment.* outbox| mq{{RabbitMQ<br/>grandvista.events}}
  b1 -->|booking.* outbox| mq
  mq -->|booking.payment-events| b1
  mq -->|notification.events| notif
  notif -->|SMTP| mail[Mailpit]
  pay -. test mode .-> rzp[(Razorpay API)]
  auth --- d1[(auth-db)]
  room --- d2[(room-db)]
  b1 --- d3[(booking-db)]
  pay --- d4[(payment-db)]
  notif --- d5[(notification-db)]
